tely \n\nalso have rc on the Claude session but having dot controlling my entire computer makes it easier to not have to intervene", "url": "https://x.com/daniallqureshi/status/2122776017341211112"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122773937092435968"]}, "author_id": "1298678501990572037", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:28:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122773943962759305"], "id": "2122773943962759305", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Successfully Indianised my Dot 😬 https://t.co/MRWfPZGcLM", "url": "https://x.com/yashasvishailly/status/2122773943962759305"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122772170048946176"]}, "author_id": "950683852497965056", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:24:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122772868270579949"], "id": "2122772868270579949", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 37, "impression_count": 11635, "like_count": 89, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "So... I also asked GPT-6.2 Astra to create this short video explaining how it made this Singapore replica\n\nshoutout to the gob, my dot, who coordinated 100+ 6.2 Astra threads for over 100 hundred hours 🥵\n\n@OpenAIDevs https://t.co/bqdAlTaevI https://t.co/cay5VRgqBX", "url": "https://x.com/gabrielchua/status/2122772868270579949"}, {"author_id": "1900386194338574336", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:18:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122771270832177429"], "id": "2122771270832177429", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ry_d_e Everything I do managing the business side of a GC runs through my dot.", "url": "https://x.com/DavidJPete/status/2122771270832177429"}, {"author_id": "1900386194338574336", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:04:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122767925669237062"], "id": "2122767925669237062", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@samyamiam Wait, I can connect my dot to text? Tell me more.", "url": "https://x.com/DavidJPete/status/2122767925669237062"}, {"author_id": "2047409569023000576", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:01:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122767001278185554"], "id": "2122767001278185554", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 99, "id": "2047409569023000576", "start": 86, "username": "1PasswordDev"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/JamesZmSun/sta…", "end": 232, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JamesZmSun/status/2122430860012191980", "start": 209, "url": "https://t.co/ewUq8ZaHUp"}]}, "text": "Upgrades, people. Upgrades. 🤝\n\nSmarter agents → more tasks that need a secure login. \n@1PasswordDev for AI and agents is coming to OpenAI dots as well, so they can sign in while your credentials stay secure:\n\nhttps://t.co/ewUq8ZaHUp"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 94, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "@OpenAIDevs Upgrades, people. Upgrades. 🤝\n\nSmarter agents → more tasks that need a secure login. \n@1PasswordDev for AI and agents is coming to OpenAI dots as well, so they can sign in while your credentials stay secure:\n\nhttps://t.co/T0MiYrshxj", "url": "https://x.com/1PasswordDev/status/2122767001278185554"}, {"author_id": "15063268", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:57:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122766189407662221"], "id": "2122766189407662221", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Why doesn’t Amazon let my Dot buy things? I’m reduced to putting an always logged in Mac mini inside a locked closet just so I can get my Dot to order for me. \n\nSeriously, @amazon , your prohibition on agents is dumb and forcing me to do dumb things. Fix it please.", "url": "https://x.com/Ainmer/status/2122766189407662221"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122764386620342272"]}, "author_id": "1655980702142443520", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:52:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122764746080571600"], "id": "2122764746080571600", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "First time posting on twitter, kinda nervous 😛\n\nAnyway, I built Limmr. It connects WhatsApp to my dot so my AI can help with group projects, forgotten replies and finding that link buried in a chat.\n\nIt’s an unofficial beta. I’d love feedback!\n\nhttps://t.co/FcHDIIjFVN https://t.co/NClNxS5EA8", "url": "https://x.com/afknavs/status/2122764746080571600"}, {"author_id": "765602994641481728", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:52:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122764740120424718"], "id": "2122764740120424718", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 91, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys @OpenAI That dotted line is mostly OpenAI dots, they really cornered the cheap and smart zone!", "url": "https://x.com/bullishchart/status/2122764740120424718"}, {"author_id": "4736729423", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:39:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122761648318697775"], "id": "2122761648318697775", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 20, "id": "1751810001751183361", "start": 10, "username": "cognition"}]}, "text": "BREAKING: @cognition just promoted Devin from engineer to engineering manager 👀\n\nHere's what Devin Bots actually do:\n\n→ You give it an outcome, not a ticket (\"Keep Android at parity with iOS\")\n→ It splits the work and runs a Devin session for each piece, each on its own machine\n→ It remembers context across weeks\n→ It lives in Slack, iMessage or the web app\n→ It only pings you when something needs your call\n\nThe receipts from Cognition:\n• Android app built in 44 days with 1,134 merged PRs\n• Beta testers merged 4.5x more PRs per message\n\nThe race is now ChatGPT Dots vs Claude Duet vs Grok Bot vs Devin Bots.."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 636, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "BREAKING: @cognition just promoted Devin from engineer to engineering manager 👀\n\nHere's what Devin Bots actually do:\n\n→ You give it an outcome, not a ticket (\"Keep Android at parity with iOS\")\n→ It splits the work and runs a Devin session for each piece, each on its own https://t.co/DEM6wxFk47", "url": "https://x.com/thisiskp_/status/2122761648318697775"}, {"author_id": "2048513175935471616", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:39:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122761440058568763"], "id": "2122761440058568763", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 150, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "when she spekos on my dot till i com https://t.co/vFdKSvVVIC", "url": "https://x.com/saidbek_dx/status/2122761440058568763"}, {"author_id": "1708630183698169856", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:25:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122757929702982020"], "id": "2122757929702982020", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 178, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@muttmoding @_jonidev I mean i get.that but also that’s just sad no? My DoT spirit carry has to be build gun to do anything infernus till EE", "url": "https://x.com/AshySunder/status/2122757929702982020"}, {"author_id": "1756587489173630976", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:19:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122756629544472615"], "id": "2122756629544472615", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@OpenAI Dots in uk ?", "ur